Set classes r,c parity.

Center line after rows 3/4: add `.cell[data-r="4"]{border-top:1px solid rgba(232,255,63,.25)}` maybe via CSS attribute.

Zone labels absolute at top/bottom edges, tiny vertical? Put top-left small. They overlay and pointer-events none. Use opacity .35.

FX layer: absolute inset 0; pointer-events:none; overflow:visible; z-index 20.
`.float{position:absolute;font-weight:900;font-size:calc(var(--cell)*.28);color:#fff;text-shadow:...;animation:floatUp .8s forwards}`; `.float.dmg{color:#ffb3b3}` `.heal{color:#7dffb0}` `.shield{color:#9dd0ff}`.
`.ring{position:absolute;border:2px solid var(--lime);border-radius:50%;width:calc(var(--cell)*...);height...;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);animation:ringOut .5s}`.

VFX positioning: left=(c+0.5)/7*100%, top=(r+0.5)/8*100%.

Shop card layout. Use CSS with grid and `min-height`.

