Note: state.sel=null; renderDetail empty; fine.

renderCombatTokens: clear unit layer, fx layer; create combat token elements from units.

`createCombatToken(u)`:
```js
const el=document.createElement('div');
el.className='unit combat'+(u.side==='enemy'?' enemy':'')+(u.boss?' boss':'');
